sequenceDiagram
    participant DS as Data Scientist
    participant LQ as LocalQueue<br/>(team-ml)
    participant CQ as ClusterQueue<br/>(gpu-pool)
    participant CO as Cohort<br/>(gpu-shared)
    participant SC as kube-scheduler
    participant GPU as GPU Node

    DS->>LQ: Submit TrainJob<br/>(4x A100, priority: low)
    LQ->>CQ: Check team quota

    alt Within nominalQuota
        CQ-->>LQ: Admitted
        CQ->>SC: Create Pods
        SC->>GPU: Schedule on GPU nodes
        GPU-->>DS: Job running
    else Over quota, borrowing available
        CQ->>CO: Request borrow<br/>from peer queues
        CO-->>CQ: 2 GPUs borrowed<br/>from team-inference (idle)
        CQ->>SC: Create Pods
        SC->>GPU: Schedule
        Note over CO: Borrowed capacity is<br/>reclaimable on demand
    else Over quota, no capacity
        CQ-->>LQ: Queued (position: 3)
        Note over LQ: Waits for capacity<br/>or preempts lower priority
    end

    Note over CO: Inference needs GPUs back
    CO->>CQ: Reclaim borrowed GPUs
    CQ->>GPU: Preempt training pods<br/>(SIGTERM then checkpoint)
    GPU-->>DS: Job checkpointed,<br/>will resume when capacity available
